5. 设计借鉴（Design references — no upstream code reused）
===============================================================================

Prism reimplements the following designs in Kotlin; no upstream code is
included. See README "开源声明与致谢" for the full mapping and the ADRs.

  - OpenClaw (MIT) —— SKILL.md format, layered loading precedence,
    progressive disclosure, tool gating
  - Open-AutoGLM (Apache-2.0) —— capability shape for LLM phone control;
    the PC/ADB approach is explicitly NOT ported
  - Cyrene-Agent —— role pack persona structure and desktop-pet rendering /
    interaction; ported assets remain user-private and are never
    distributed with this project
  - TencentDB-Agent-Memory —— L2 atomic memory extraction
  - mem0, CALMem —— three-layer memory architecture comparison
  - Continuous-learning (author's prior project) —— skills / memory
    architecture and knowledge-base asset selection methodology
  - gstack —— code-review template structure
  - OneBot 11 —— publicly specified messaging protocol

===============================================================================
6. 仅连接、不分发（Connected, not distributed）
===============================================================================

The QQ companion feature can connect to a user-deployed OneBot 11
implementation such as NapCat (https://github.com/NapNeko/NapCatQQ) or
SnowLuma. Those projects use non-OSI "source-available" licenses that
prohibit commercial use and unauthorized redistribution. Prism does not
bundle, embed, or redistribute them; it only speaks HTTP / WebSocket to an
instance the user runs. Without a protocol endpoint, the feature uses
Android accessibility only.

===============================================================================
7. 用户私有资产（User-private assets, not distributed）
===============================================================================

Role packs, pet / Live2D assets, voice packs and training material are
imported by the user into the app's private storage. They are not part of
this repository, are not shipped in the APK, and their licensing is the
user's responsibility.
